dbr:Lamerica a dbo:Film ;
    rdfs:label "Lamerica"@en ;
    dbo:abstract "Lamerica is a 1994 Italian drama film directed by Gianni Amelio. It entered the competition at the 51st Venice International Film Festival, in which Amelio won the Golden Osella for Best Director. The film was selected as the Italian entry for the Best Foreign Language Film at the 67th Academy Awards, but was not accepted as a nominee."@en ;
